new('12. Practice scenarios and answer key')
p('Use these in a supervised onboarding session. The recommended assessment is not a company scoring policy. Ask the manager to state the next permitted action, the hold condition, the required evidence and the accountable role. Mark each competency individually; do not grant live authority merely because a quiz is passed.')
EXAMS=[
('Prospect liked the deck; actual strategy is requested before readiness is confirmed.','Hold actual-strategy work. Sales/BD and AM confirm readiness to sign after meeting one before AM/SM/MM/MB develop the actual strategy.'),
('Mixed-service contract of 10,000 units is signed; 5,000 is verified. Can delivery start?','Only if the four-part signed pack and authorized verification are complete; the illustrative 50% minimum is met. If social-only, it is not enough.'),
('The folder is standalone on Drive but payment evidence is missing.','Folder movement is a signature milestone, not payment evidence. Contracted delivery remains held.'),
('Writer uploads a calendar and receives comments. Should a new review calendar be created?','Content comments stay on the same calendar PPTX; keep task/item references and owner execution responses traceable.'),
('HD approved a video. Is that the required video-quality gate?','No. User confirmed MM performs video quality; editors report directly to MM. MM quality and final internal decisions must be recorded.'),
('Holder marks edits done while two reviewer comments remain unresolved.','Task stays open. Holder executes all comments and reviewers decide the required approvals; status text alone does not close the loop.'),
('MM approved the assets; the client has not approved AM’s presentation.','Hold publication. AM presents one finalized PPTX and records final external client approval for that version.'),
('SM only reports that posts were published. What is missing from the role review?','Check private-label calendar collection, strategy, performance reports, listening reports, scheduling and page replies as applicable—not publication alone.'),
('Media plan budget was 20,000, but actual agreed-basis expenses after execution are 8,000.','Illustrative fee is 25% × 8,000 = 2,000, subject to agreed expense definition and terms. Planned budget is not actual spend.'),
('MM is unavailable; a holder wants to self-approve to meet a date.','Use only a confirmed authorized backup; otherwise ask owner to assign authority and record the hold. Urgency does not create an override.'),
('An output changes after client approval.','Identify affected scope/version, repeat applicable internal reviews and renewed client decision before releasing changed material.'),
('Public Reel views are very high; can the report state ad spend was confirmed?','No. Public patterns can inform an interpretation, not confirm paid boosting or spend. Record that ad-account evidence is unavailable.')]
